      "source": "A WebFlux application can simply inject PreFlightRequestHandler and use\nit to create an instance of this WebFilter since <code>@EnableWebFlux</code>\ndeclares <code>DispatcherHandler</code> as a bean and that is a\nPreFlightRequestHandler.",
      "translation": "WebFlux 应用程序可以简单地注入 PreFlightRequestHandler 并使用它来创建该 WebFilter 的实例，因为 `<code>@EnableWebFlux</code>` 声明了 `DispatcherHandler` 为 Bean，而它就是 PreFlightRequestHandler。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Process the Web request and (optionally) delegate to the next\n<code>WebFilter</code> through the given <a href=\"../../server/WebFilterChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebFilterChain</code></a>.",
      "translation": "处理 Web 请求，并（可选地）通过给定的<a href=\"../../server/WebFilterChain.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebFilterChain</code></a>委托到下一个<code>WebFilter</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create an instance that will delegate to the given handler.",
      "translation": "创建一个将委托给给定处理程序的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
